  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Cain was very wroth, Gen. 4:5 (Moses 5:21). Moses was wroth with them, Ex. 16:20. one man sin, and wilt thou be wroth with all, Num. 16:22. Lord was wroth with me for your sakes, Deut. 3:26. Naaman was wroth, 2 Kgs. 5:11. Lord heard this, and was wroth, Ps. 78:21. I was wroth with my people, Isa. 47:6. I would not be wroth with thee, Isa. 54:9 (3 Ne. 22:9). neither will I be always wroth, Isa. 57:16.",
